# CODEOWNERS — Conveyal CLA ledger
#
# This repository holds legal agreements and signature records. Human changes
# to the agreement texts and policies require owner review. Pair with branch
# protection that requires CODEOWNER review on pull requests.

# Default: all human changes reviewed by ledger owners.
*                                   @conveyal/core

# Agreement texts, governance, privacy, and license — highest scrutiny.
/CLA.md                             @conveyal/core
/GOVERNANCE.md                      @conveyal/core
/PRIVACY.md                         @conveyal/core
/LICENSE                            @conveyal/core
/cla/                               @conveyal/core
/versions/                          @conveyal/core
/signatures/                        @conveyal/core
/.github/workflows/cla.yml          @conveyal/core

# NOTE: signature files are contributor-submitted via pull request.
# validate-signature.yml checks opener identity, required fields, and verbatim
# CLA text; a Conveyal maintainer then reviews and merges the record. The
# catch-all intentionally covers signature PRs too: review and merge are the
# acceptance step.
